  "notes": [
    "Minion search now filters only what is displayed; it no longer recalculates the ranking using only matching results.",
    "The # column preserves each minion\u2019s rank from the full selected ranking population, so searching for one minion still shows how profitable it is relative to the others.",
    "Adds a regression test to ensure search never changes a minion\u2019s global rank."
